              Complete overview of our 8 core powders (Tomato, Tamarind,
              Caramel, Lemon, Mango, Spinach, Ginger, Apple) covering sensory
              notes, processing methods, and standard bulk packing.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between"
          >
            <ChatLink
              class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 inline-flex items-center gap-1 min-h-[44px]"
            />
            <span class="text-xs text-white/60 font-mono"
              >PDF &bull; 2.4 MB</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#121214] border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <div>
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 font-display font-bold text-lg mb-4"
            >
              DOC
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">
              Certificate of Analysis Format
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-body">
              Representative Certificate of Analysis format showing typical
              analytical metrics: moisture percentage, mesh distribution, bulk
              density, and organoleptic checks.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between"
          >
            <ChatLink
              class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 inline-flex items-center gap-1 min-h-[44px]"
            />
            <span class="text-xs text-white/60 font-mono">B2B Verified</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#121214] border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1"
        >
          <div>
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 font-display font-bold text-lg mb-4"
            >
              SPEC
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">
              Packaging & Storage Guidelines
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-body">
              Storage recommendations, barrier liner handling, and warehouse
              temperature guidelines to maintain optimum powder flowability and
              shelf longevity.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between"
          >
            <ChatLink
              class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 inline-flex items-center gap-1 min-h-[44px]"
            />
            <span class="text-xs text-white/60 font-mono">Handling Sheet</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div> -->

      <!-- Product-Specific Specification Sheets Table in responsive container -->
      <div
        class="mt-16 bg-[#121214] border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8"
      >
        <div class="mb-6">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white">
            Product Specification Sheets (TDS)
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/70 mt-1">
            Technical Data Sheets detailing mesh grading, dry solids content,
            and application compatibility.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="table-responsive"
          tabindex="0"
          role="region"
          aria-label="Table, scrolls horizontally on small screens"
        >
          <table class="w-full text-left text-sm text-white/80 min-w-[540px]">
            <thead
              class="border-b border-white/10 text-xs uppercase text-white/50 font-mono bg-white/5"
            >
              <tr>
                <th scope="col" class="py-3 px-4">Product Name</th>
                <th scope="col" class="py-3 px-4">Category</th>
                <th scope="col" class="py-3 px-4">Standard Mesh</th>
                <th scope="col" class="py-3 px-4">Action</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-white/5 font-body">
              {
                products.map((p) => (
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-medium text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                      <span
                        class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full shrink-0"
                        style={{ backgroundColor: p.accentColor }}
                      />
                      <span>{p.name} Powder</span>
                    </td>
                    <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-white/70 capitalize">
                      {p.cat}
                    </td>
                    <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-amber-300">
                      {p.specs.particleSize &&
                      !p.specs.particleSize.includes("[ADD")
                        ? p.specs.particleSize
                        : "On request"}
                    </td>
                    <td class="py-3.5 px-4">
                      <span class="text-xs text-white/60">On request</span>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                ))
              }
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- One Closing CTA Section Near the End of the Page -->
  <section
    class="py-20 bg-[#0e0e12] text-white text-center border-t border-white/10"
  >
    <div class="section-container max-w-3xl">
      <span
        class="text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-widest text-white/60 block mb-3 font-mono"
        >Technical Assistance</span
      >
      <h2
        class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4 tracking-tight"
      >
        Need custom analytical specifications or regulatory documentation?
      </h2>
      <p
        class="text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-body"
      >
        Our technical team works with food scientists and quality audit teams to
        provide documentation packages tailored to your country and regulatory
        requirements.
      </p>
      <ChatLink class="btn-accent min-h-[44px]" />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
